# ART-ALL04 -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. ALL04 (URBAN, Chicago): the Chicago Associates Center (CACHIG04) and Water Tower (CACHIG06) from isogen.mix; both Soviet Naval Yards (NAYARD) on the water.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL04U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
cheat view_building CACHIG04
wait 2
shot associates
cheat view_building CACHIG06
wait 2
shot watertower
cheat view_building NAYARD
wait 2
shot nayard
